[al:新概念英语第一册]
[ti:57. An Unusual Day]
[00:00.700]Lesson 57 | 第57课
[00:03.125]It is 8 o'clock. | 现在是八点钟。
[00:06.140]The children go to school by car every day. | 孩子们每天开车去学校。
[00:10.725]But today they are going to school on foot. | 但今天他们是步行去学校。
[00:15.745]It is 10 o'clock. | 现在是十点钟。
[00:19.360]Mrs. Sawyer usually stays at home in the morning, | 索耶夫人通常上午呆在家里，
[00:23.815]but this morning she is going to the shops. | 但今天上午她要去商店。
[00:28.230]It is 4 o'clock. | 现在是四点钟。
[00:31.530]In the afternoon, Mrs. Sawyer usually drinks tea in the living room. | 下午，索耶夫人通常在客厅喝茶。
[00:37.680]But this afternoon she is drinking tea in the garden. | 但今天下午她正在花园里喝茶。
[00:42.910]It is 6 o'clock. | 现在是六点钟。
[00:45.930]In the evening, the children usually do their homework. | 晚上，孩子们通常做作业。
[00:50.695]But this evening they are not doing their homework. | 但今晚他们没有做作业。
[00:54.660]At the moment they are playing in the garden. | 此刻他们正在花园里玩耍。
[00:58.755]It is 9 o'clock. | 现在是九点钟。
[01:01.945]Mr. Sawyer usually reads his newspaper at night, | 索耶先生通常晚上看报纸，
[01:05.480]but he's not reading his newspaper tonight. | 但他今晚没有看报纸。
[01:09.185]At the moment he's reading an interesting book. | 此刻他正在读一本有趣的书。